strongly in favour of the authenticity of the Ring of Nestor and related 
rings.", "document_ref": "d1", "source_ref": "s1", "qualifiers": [], 
"limitations": [], "confidence": "high"},
    {"local_ref": "st4", "text": "Vlachopoulos dates the Ring of Nestor to the 
